      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design Twitter",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design Twitter",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cMPd6ezkZn0wsWatQMTwA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 274.50390625,
      "y": 193.3125,
      "width": 878.66796875,
      "height": 1375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 564942554,
      "version": 1380,
      "versionNonce": 1498572742,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1742624527207,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirements:\n1. User can post, edit or delete a tweet\n2. User can follow other people\n3. User should be able to view timelines from the people they follow\n4. User can comment, like on posts\n5. User can Search for tweet\n\nNon functional requirements:\n1. Highly available -> timelines, posts\n2. Eventual consistency -> a 10s delay in reflecting post on user's feed is acceptable\n3. Scalable -> multiple concurrent user can access the platform\n4. Low latency -> timelines, search\n\nBack of the envelope calculation:\n\n1. 100M DAU\n    a. writes: 50M posts + 50M comments + 1000M likes -> 1100M / 86400 -> 11k TPS\n    ~ 50k TPS\n    b. reads: 500k TPS\n2. Storage\n    a. 50M * 200B + 50M * 100B + 20B * 1000M -> 10GB + 5GB + 20GB + 5MB * 5M\n    ~ 35GB + 25TB per day * 3650 ~ 100PB\n\nCore entities:\n1. User\nuserId: UUID\nname\ndob: timestamp\nisActive\ncreatedAt: timestamp\n\n2. Tweet\ntweetId: UUID\nuserId: FK, User\ntext\nurls[]\ncreatedAt\n\n3. Follow\nfollowerId: FK, User\nfolloweeId: FK, User\nisActive: boolean\ncreatedAt: timestamp\n\n4. Comment\ncommentId: UUID\ntext: varchar(100)\nparentType: CommentParentType(POST, COMMENT)\nentityId: FK, Comment | FK, Tweet\ncreatedAt: timestamp\n\n5. Like\ncommentId: UUID\nparentType: LikeParentType(POST, COMMENT)\nentityId: FK, Comment | FK, Tweet",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requirements:\n1. User can post, edit or delete a tweet\n2. User can follow other people\n3. User should be able to view timelines from the people they follow\n4. User can comment, like on posts\n5. User can Search for tweet\n\nNon functional requirements:\n1. Highly available -> timelines, posts\n2. Eventual consistency -> a 10s delay in reflecting post on user's feed is acceptable\n3. Scalable -> multiple concurrent user can access the platform\n4. Low latency -> timelines, search\n\nBack of the envelope calculation:\n\n1. 100M DAU\n    a. writes: 50M posts + 50M comments + 1000M likes -> 1100M / 86400 -> 11k TPS\n    ~ 50k TPS\n    b. reads: 500k TPS\n2. Storage\n    a. 50M * 200B + 50M * 100B + 20B * 1000M -> 10GB + 5GB + 20GB + 5MB * 5M\n    ~ 35GB + 25TB per day * 3650 ~ 100PB\n\nCore entities:\n1. User\nuserId: UUID\nname\ndob: timestamp\nisActive\ncreatedAt: timestamp\n\n2. Tweet\ntweetId: UUID\nuserId: FK, User\ntext\nurls[]\ncreatedAt\n\n3. Follow\nfollowerId: FK, User\nfolloweeId: FK, User\nisActive: boolean\ncreatedAt: timestamp\n\n4. Comment\ncommentId: UUID\ntext: varchar(100)\nparentType: CommentParentType(POST, COMMENT)\nentityId: FK, Comment | FK, Tweet\ncreatedAt: timestamp\n\n5. Like\ncommentId: UUID\nparentType: LikeParentType(POST, COMMENT)\nentityId: FK, Comment | FK, Tweet",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vKMYxq8zNWE3zlCDY3esd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1488.3338345722964,
      "y": 159.30212874838787,
      "width": 862.3093305659135,
      "height": 1175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 763447962,
      "version": 694,
      "versionNonce": 1765629850,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1742624527207,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "APIs:\n\n1. POST /api/v1/tweet?page=1&limit=20\nreq headers -> JWT token -> userId\n{\n    \"text\": \"\",\n    \"media\": binary,\n    \"createdAt\"\n}\n\nreturns -> postId\n\n2. GET /api/v1/tweet/{tweetId} -> Tweet\n\n3. POST /api/v1/user/follow\n{\n    \"followType\": \"Follow\" | \"Unfollo\"\n    \"followId\": \"\"\n}\n\n4. POST /api/v1/tweet/{tweetId}/comment?page=1&limit=20\n{\n    \"text\": \"\"\n}\n\n5. POST /api/v1/tweet/{tweetId}/like?page=1&limit=20\n\n6. POST /api/v1/tweet/{tweetId}/comment/{commentId}/comment\n{\n    \"text\": \"\"\n}\n\n7. POST /api/v1/tweet/{tweetId}/comment/{commentId}/like\n\n8. GET /api/v1/user/timeline?page=1&limit=20\n\n{\n    \"data\": [{\n        \"tweetId\": \"\",\n        \"text\": \"\",\n        media: URLS[]\n        \"likes\": 100,\n        \"comments\": 1000,\n    }]\n\n}\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "APIs:\n\n1. POST /api/v1/tweet?page=1&limit=20\nreq headers -> JWT token -> userId\n{\n    \"text\": \"\",\n    \"media\": binary,\n    \"createdAt\"\n}\n\nreturns -> postId\n\n2. GET /api/v1/tweet/{tweetId} -> Tweet\n\n3. POST /api/v1/user/follow\n{\n    \"followType\": \"Follow\" | \"Unfollo\"\n    \"followId\": \"\"\n}\n\n4. POST /api/v1/tweet/{tweetId}/comment?page=1&limit=20\n{\n    \"text\": \"\"\n}\n\n5. POST /api/v1/tweet/{tweetId}/like?page=1&limit=20\n\n6. POST /api/v1/tweet/{tweetId}/comment/{commentId}/comment\n{\n    \"text\": \"\"\n}\n\n7. POST /api/v1/tweet/{tweetId}/comment/{commentId}/like\n\n8. GET /api/v1/user/timeline?page=1&limit=20\n\n{\n    \"data\": [{\n        \"tweetId\": \"\",\n        \"text\": \"\",\n        media: URLS[]\n        \"likes\": 100,\n        \"comments\": 1000,\n    }]\n\n}\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
